# ---- hardware classes this image has no owner or device for: USB host role (L3 is peripheral-only; the
# S2MM005 Type-C controller, the host role and DisplayPort are left out by user decision, plan 1.2 X-54), and
# with it USB storage/UAS, Type-C, UVC, USB audio (X-48), USB joysticks and the vendor HID drivers (plan 2.5);
# NVMe, NVDIMM/PMEM, virtio-fs (guest side), WireGuard (plan 2.5; the WireGuard app falls back to its
# userspace implementation).
